  "description": "Extends Microsoft QuickGrid with column resizing, drag-and-drop reordering, a column chooser, CSV/Excel/PDF export, and state management (localStorage persistence and developer preference API).",
  "id": "AtharvaITS.QuickGrid.Extensions",
